window.CILIN_SENT_NOTES=[{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 1, sent 2","en":"As a boy, Perkin's curiosity prompted early interests in the arts, sciences, photography, and engineering.","zh":"“幼时的好奇心让珀金早早对艺术、科学、摄影和工程产生了兴趣。”","note":"prompted early interests → 使…早早产生兴趣；四并列名词用顿号。","words":["prompt","early","interest"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 2, sent 3","en":"Those speeches fired the young chemist's enthusiasm further...","zh":"“这些讲座进一步点燃了年轻化学家的热情。”","note":"fire enthusiasm → 点燃热情；比喻直译保留。","words":["fire","enthusiasm"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 4, sent 1","en":"At the time, quinine was the only viable medical treatment for malaria.","zh":"“当时，奎宁是唯一可行的疟疾治疗药物。”","note":"viable medical treatment → 可行的医疗手段；定语前置。","words":["medical","treatment"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 5, sent 2","en":"Luckily, Perkin's scientific training and nature prompted him to investigate the substance further.","zh":"“幸运的是，珀金的科学素养和天性促使他进一步研究这种物质。”","note":"scientific training and nature → 科学素养和天性；prompt sb to do 促使。","words":["scientific","training","nature"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 6, sent 1","en":"Historically, textile dyes were made from such natural sources as plants and animal excretions.","zh":"“历史上，纺织染料取自植物和动物分泌物等天然来源。”","note":"animal excretions → 动物分泌物；such…as…结构。","words":["animal","textile"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 7, sent 2","en":"He asked advice of Scottish dye works owner Robert Pullar, who assured him that manufacturing the dye would be well worth it if the colour remained fast and the cost was relatively low.","zh":"“他请教苏格兰染厂主罗伯特·普拉，后者保证，只要颜色不褪色且成本较低，生产这种染料就大有可为。”","note":"remained fast → 不褪色；worth it → 大有可为。","words":["remain","fast","worth"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 8, sent 2","en":"Utilising the cheap and plentiful coal tar that was an almost unlimited by-product of London's gas street lighting...","zh":"“利用伦敦煤气街灯产生的大量廉价煤焦油——这种几乎无限的副产品……”","note":"utilising → 利用；by-product → 副产品；长定语前置。","words":["cheap","plentiful"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 9, sent 3","en":"The dye was bold and fast, and the public clamoured for more.","zh":"“这种染料色泽鲜艳且不易褪色，公众争相抢购。”","note":"bold and fast → 鲜艳+不褪色；clamoured for → 争相抢购。","words":["bold","fast"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 10, sent 2","en":"The dyes also became vital to medical research in many ways.","zh":"“这些染料还在多方面成为医学研究的关键。”","note":"became vital to → 成为……的关键；in many ways → 多方面。","words":["vital","way"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 10, last sent","en":"And, in what would have been particularly pleasing to Perkin, their current use is in the search for a vaccine against malaria.","zh":"“尤为令珀金欣慰的是，如今这些染料正被用于寻找抗疟疾疫苗。”","note":"in what would have been pleasing → 令……欣慰的是；current use → 如今被用于。","words":["please","current","use"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document2"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 1, sent 3","en":"The family often stayed at Press Castle, the large mansion on the northern edge of the property...","zh":"“一家人常住在地产北缘的大宅——普雷斯城堡。”","note":"同位语Press Castle后置，用破折号代替逗号，符合中文长定语习惯。","words":["family","often"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 2, sent 2","en":"Although he never liked the prospect of a business career, he stayed with it to please his family.","zh":"“尽管他从未喜欢过从商的前景，却还是为了取悦家人而坚持。”","note":"stayed with it → 坚持；prospect→前景；please his family→取悦家人。","words":["stay","prospect","please"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 3, sent 1","en":"Henderson learned photography in Montreal around the year 1857 and quickly took it up as a serious amateur.","zh":"“亨德森约1857年在蒙特利尔学习摄影，并迅速以认真的业余爱好者身份投身其中。”","note":"took it up as→以……身份投身；serious amateur→认真的业余爱好者。","words":["take","serious","amateur"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 3, sent 3","en":"They belonged to the same societies and were among the founding members of the Art Association of Montreal.","zh":"“他们参加了同一社团，且均为蒙特利尔艺术协会的创始成员。”","note":"belonged to the same societies→参加了同一社团；founding members→创始成员。","words":["belong","society","found"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 4, sent 2","en":"While Notman’s landscapes were noted for their bold realism, Henderson for the first 20 years of his career produced romantic images...","zh":"“诺特曼的风景以大胆写实著称，而亨德森在职业生涯前20年却致力于浪漫影像……”","note":"while→对照；noted for→以……著称；bold realism→大胆写实。","words":["note","bold"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 5, sent 1","en":"There was little competing hobby or amateur photography before the late 1880s because of the time-consuming techniques involved and the weight of the equipment.","zh":"“1880年代前，几乎无人能与其竞争业余摄影，因工艺耗时、设备笨重。”","note":"little competing hobby→几乎无竞争爱好；time-consuming & weight→耗时+笨重，合并四字短语。","words":["little","compete","hobby"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 6, sent 2","en":"He was especially fond of the wilderness and often travelled by canoe on the Blanche, du Lièvre and other noted eastern rivers.","zh":"“他尤爱荒野，常乘独木舟穿梭于布兰奇河、杜列夫河等东部名川。”","note":"was especially fond of→尤爱；travelled by canoe→乘独木舟穿梭；noted→名川。","words":["especially","fond","travel"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 7, sent 1","en":"This undertaking led in 1875 to a commission from the railway to record the principal structures along the almost-completed line connecting Montreal to Halifax.","zh":"“这一行动使他在1875年受铁路委托，记录蒙特利尔至哈利法克斯这条即将竣工干线的主要构筑物。”","note":"undertaking→行动；almost-completed line→即将竣工的干线；principal structures→主要构筑物。","words":["undertaking","line","principal"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Para 8, sent 2","en":"When Henderson died in 1913, his huge collection of glass negatives was stored in the basement of his house.","zh":"“1913年亨德森去世时，其大批玻璃底片被存放在自家地下室。”","note":"huge collection of glass negatives→大批玻璃底片；was stored→被存放。","words":["huge","collection","glass"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u1","loc":"Last sent","en":"Today collections of his work are held at the National Archives of Canada, Ottawa, and the McCord Museum of Canadian History.","zh":"“如今，他的作品收藏于加拿大国家档案馆（渥太华）及麦科德加拿大历史博物馆。”","note":"collections of his work→他的作品收藏；held at→收藏于；括号补地名，符合中文习惯。","words":["collection","work"],"source":"课件 Unit 1 Biographies.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 1, sent 1","en":"Virtually every child, the world over, plays.","zh":"“几乎全世界每一个儿童都会游戏。”","note":"virtually = almost；the world over = all over the world 倒装","words":["virtually","world","over"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 1, sent 2","en":"The drive to play is so intense that children will do so in any circumstances.","zh":"“游戏冲动如此强烈，以至于儿童在任何环境下都会去玩。”","note":"drive = 内驱力；so…that 结果从句","words":["drive","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 2, sent 1","en":"Our society has created a false dichotomy between play and learning.","zh":"“社会在‘游戏’与‘学习’之间制造了虚假的二分法。”","note":"false dichotomy 固定术语“虚假二分”","words":["society","create"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 3, sent 1","en":"Play is pleasurable, intrinsically motivated, process-oriented and non-literal.","zh":"“游戏是令人愉悦的、内在驱动的、重过程的、非字面意义的。”","note":"四并列形容词，用顿号拆解","words":["play","motivate"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 3, sent 3","en":"When a child is pressured, they will likely not think of the activity as play.","zh":"“一旦儿童感到被强迫，他们很可能就不会把该活动视为游戏。”","note":"pressured 被动→“感到被强迫”；单数 they","words":["child","pressure"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 5, sent 2","en":"At this mid-point between play and work… the child’s motivation, coupled with guidance from an adult, can create robust opportunities…","zh":"“在游戏与工作的中间地带，儿童的动机再加上成人的引导，就能产生强劲的游戏式学习契机。”","note":"coupled with = 再加上；robust = 强劲","words":["couple","robust"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 4, sent 1","en":"Guided play takes two forms.","zh":"“引导性游戏有两种形式。”","note":"takes two forms 固定搭配“表现为两种形式”","words":["guide","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 5, sent 3","en":"Adults can enrich the environment by providing objects or experiences that promote aspects of a curriculum.","zh":"“成人可通过提供能促进课程各要素的物体或体验来丰富环境。”","note":"promote aspects of a curriculum = 促进课程各要素","words":["promote","aspect","curriculum"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Para 6, sent 2","en":"Play should stem from the child’s own interests and intentions.","zh":"“游戏应源于儿童自身的兴趣与意图。”","note":"stem from = 源于（比 come from 正式）","words":["stem","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"Last sentence","en":"Play, in short, is the serious work of childhood.","zh":"“简言之，游戏就是童年的正经事。”","note":"serious work 意译“正经事”保留反差","words":["play","short"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document12"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Play may look like a carefree and exuberant way to pass the time before the hard work of adulthood comes along, but there’s much more to it than that.","zh":"“玩耍看似只是成年繁重工作来临前一种无忧无虑、兴高采烈的打发时间方式，实则远非如此。”","note":"①肯定+转折长句→先“看似”后“实则”；②carefree/exuberant合并为“无忧无虑、兴高采烈”避免重复；③pass the time→“打发时间”口语化。","words":["time","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Eighty percent of deaths among juvenile fur seals occur because playing pups fail to spot predators approaching.","zh":"“幼海豹死亡案例中有八成是因为贪玩的小海豹未能察觉逼近的捕食者。”","note":"①juvenile fur seals→“幼海豹”；②playing pups→“贪玩的小海豹”增词显义；③fail to spot→“未能察觉”否定式动词。","words":["fur","seal","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"You just don’t find animals wasting energy like that,\" he adds. \"There must be a payoff.","zh":"“你根本不会发现动物就这样白白耗掉能量，”他补充说，“这其中必定有回报。”","note":"①just don’t find→“根本不会发现”加强否定；②wasting energy like that→“就这样白白耗掉能量”口语化；③payoff→“回报”保留悬念。","words":["find","waste","energy"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"A popular explanation of play has been that it helps juveniles develop the skills they will need to hunt, mate and socialise as adults.","zh":"“一种流行的解释认为，玩耍帮助幼体发育成年后捕猎、交配与社交所需的技能。”","note":"①popular explanation→“流行的解释”；②juveniles→“幼体”涵盖动物幼崽；③hunt, mate and socialise→三动词并列，用“捕猎、交配与社交”保持节奏。","words":["popular","explanation","mate"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Byers points out that the benefits of increased exercise disappear rapidly after training stops, so any improvement in endurance resulting from juvenile play would be lost by adulthood.","zh":"“拜尔斯指出，增肌锻炼带来的好处在训练停止后会迅速消失，因此幼年玩耍所带来的任何耐力提升到了成年都会荡然无存。”","note":"①disappear rapidly→“迅速消失”；②resulting from→“所带来的”后置定语；③would be lost by adulthood→“到了成年都会荡然无存”用成语增强语气。","words":["disappear","rapidly","result"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Behavioral ecologist Tim Caro... found that the way the cats played had no significant effect on their hunting prowess in later life.","zh":"“行为生态学家蒂姆·卡罗发现，小猫玩耍的方式对其日后捕猎能力并无显著影响。”","note":"①hunting prowess→“捕猎能力”专业词；②in later life→“日后”避免直译“余生”；③no significant effect→“并无显著影响”学术腔。","words":["hunt","later","life"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"There is a strong positive link between brain size and playfulness among mammals in general.","zh":"“总体而言，哺乳动物的大脑大小与贪玩程度之间存在显著正相关。”","note":"①strong positive link→“显著正相关”固定搭配；②playfulness→“贪玩程度”拟人化；③in general→“总体而言”置前符合中文节奏。","words":["strong","positive","link"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Play in cats, rats and mice is at its most intense just as this 'window of opportunity' reaches its peak.","zh":"“猫、大鼠与小鼠的玩耍恰好在这扇‘机会之窗’达到顶峰时最为剧烈。”","note":"①window of opportunity→“机会之窗”保留比喻；②at its most intense→“最为剧烈”；③just as→“恰好”体现同步。","words":["window","opportunity","intense"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Such behavior activates many different parts of the brain, he reasons, likening it to a behavioral kaleidoscope.","zh":"“他认为，这种行为会激活大脑多个不同区域，并将其比作一个‘行为万花筒’。”","note":"①he reasons→“他认为”插入语提前；②likening it to→“并将其比作”分词转动词；③behavioral kaleidoscope→“行为万花筒”直译保留修辞。","words":["reason","behavior"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"We already know that rat pups denied the chance to play grow smaller brain components and fail to develop the ability to apply social rules when they interact with their peers.","zh":"“我们已知，被剥夺玩耍机会的大鼠幼崽不仅脑区体积更小，而且在与同伴互动时也无法形成运用社交规则的能力。”","note":"①denied the chance to play→“被剥夺玩耍机会”被动转主动；②grow smaller brain components→“脑区体积更小”意译；③apply social rules→“运用社交规则”专业动词短语。","words":["chance","play","grow"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document5"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Play in all its rich variety is one of the highest achievements of the human species…","zh":"“丰富多样的游戏是人类物种最卓越的成就之一”","note":"最高级+抽象名词achievement，需增词“卓越”才能托住语气。","words":["play","rich"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"…a make-believe world, brick by brick, fire-breathing dragons, wicked witches and gallant heroes…","zh":"“一块砖一块砖地搭建幻想世界：喷火巨龙、邪恶女巫、英勇英雄”","note":"并列意象密集，用冒号+顿号保留节奏；brick by brick拆成“一块砖一块砖地”显画面。","words":["world","brick"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"…this fantasy is helping her take her first steps towards her capacity for creativity…","zh":"“这种幻想正帮她迈出培养创造力的第一步”","note":"take her first steps towards→“迈出…的第一步”固定套译；capacity增动词“培养”。","words":["take","first","step"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"When she bosses him around as his teacher, she’s practising how to regulate her emotions through pretence.","zh":"“当她扮老师支使弟弟时，其实是在通过假装练习情绪调节”","note":"boss around口语“支使”；through pretence→“通过假装”副词化，避免“通过伪装”生硬。","words":["through","boss"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"We are mindful of a worldwide decline in play, pointing out that over half the people now live in cities.","zh":"“我们注意到，全球范围内游戏活动正在衰退，并指出如今过半人口居住在城市”","note":"mindful of→“注意到”；decline in play转译为“游戏活动正在衰退”补全主语。","words":["decline","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Opportunities for free play are becoming increasingly scarce, he says, curtailed by perceptions of risk to do with traffic, as well as parents’ increased wish to protect…","zh":"“他指出，自由游戏的机会日益稀缺，被‘交通危险’的观念以及家长愈发强烈的保护欲所限制”","note":"curtailed by被动转主动“被…所限制”；perceptions of risk补具体“交通危险”显化语境。","words":["opportunity","free"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"The type of play we are interested in is child-initiated, spontaneous and unpredictable—but as soon as you ask a five-year-old ‘to play’, you as the researcher have intervened.","zh":"“我们关注的游戏类型是由儿童自发、即兴且不可预测的——可一旦你要求一个五岁孩子‘来玩吧’，身为研究者的你就已经介入了”","note":"破折号前后转折，用“可”字对应but；child-initiated→“由儿童自发”短定语。","words":["type","play"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"A strong possibility is that play supports the early development of children’s self-control…","zh":"“一种很大的可能是，游戏有助于儿童自我控制的早期发展”","note":"A strong possibility is that…→“一种很大的可能是”保留学术缓冲语气。","words":["strong","possibility"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Playful behaviour is also an important indicator of healthy social and emotional development.","zh":"“游戏行为也是衡量社会性与情绪健康发展的重要指标”","note":"indicator→“指标”名词化；healthy加后缀“发展”形成术语搭配。","words":["important","healthy"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"},{"unit":"u2","loc":"","en":"Let’s make sure children have a rich diet of play experiences.","zh":"“让我们确保孩子们享有丰富的‘游戏营养餐’”","note":"rich diet直译“丰富的饮食”显生硬；加引号“游戏营养餐”既保留比喻，又符合中文宣传语境。","words":["let","make"],"source":"课件 Unit+2+Play.pptx · Document6"}];
